      "caption": "Figure 2 : Overview of the CodeAlign framework. The two training stages are: (1) code space construction for each modality and (2) feature–code–feature (FCF) translation between modalities, both trained using single-modality data. Step (3) illustrates the inference process, in which modality A has never encountered modality B during offline training, yet can still collaborate with it seamlessly.",
