      "caption": "Figure 2. Overview of the proposed SAME framework. SAME operates under the HIL setting and performs Sparse Finetuning with a Double-Anchor constraint. The upper row illustrates Sparse Finetuning and Knowledge Injection, where new key–value pairs (K1, V1) are used to inject new task-specific knowledge into the FFN-out layer. The lower row shows the Knowledge Anchor and Parameter Anchor mechanisms, which preserve pretrained semantics and ensure stable adaptation.",
