    "extraction": {
      "figure": "Figure 4",
      "caption": "Figure 4 : Overall pipeline of the proposed FGAesQ . FGAesQ learns discriminative aesthetic scores from relative ranks through three modules: (a) Difference-preserved Tokenization (DiffToken) selectively maintains difference regions at their original resolution while downscaling others. (b) Comparative Text-assisted Alignment (CTAlign) achieves distinctive aesthetic visual representations. (c) Rank-aware Regression (RankReg) rectifies the coarse-grained score regression with fine-grained aesthetic rankings.",
      "image_url": "https://arxiv.org/html/2603.03907v1/fig/fig4.png",
      "figureAnchor": "S3.F4",
      "panelIndex": 0,
