      "caption": "Figure 2 : Overview of the proposed exposure-time-dependent turbulence synthesis pipeline. The exposure-time τ \\tau is treated as a continuous input parameter to both the ET-MTF and blur-width field formulations. By systematically varying τ \\tau , our pipeline generates turbulence-degraded images with physically consistent blur characteristics from the input tilt image.",
