      "figure": "Figure 2",
      "caption": "Figure 2. Overview of our MAPLE framework. Document pages are encoded into sparse foreground latents, which are or- dered in raster and fed into a single LLM under a causal image- only mask. The LLM outputs latent hypotheses that condition a raster autoregressive image decoder to reconstruct the page. LLMs are optimized jointly by visual pretraining and traditional text pre- training.",
