      "figure": "Figure 2",
      "caption": "Figure 2 : Overview of the proposed E 2 OAL framework. Each AL round consists of two stages:\n(1) Adaptive class estimation and calibration-aware training, where latent unknown classes are discovered via label-guided clustering and incorporated into model learning through Dirichlet-based auxiliary supervision;\n(2) Flexible two-stage query selection, where a high-purity candidate pool is first constructed using a purity score guided by a target query precision, followed by informativeness-driven sample selection.",
