      "figure": "Figure 2",
      "caption": "Figure 2 : Framework. CoE is a training-free CoT framework for MMS with text-only output.\nGiven a video-text pair ( 𝑽 , 𝑻 ) (\\bm{V},\\bm{T}) , Module 1 constructs a Hierarchical Event Graph (HEG) that organizes global events, sub-events, and entity-relation structures.\nGuided by the HEG, Module 2 grounds video clips to sub-events and their visual entity-relation graphs.\nModule 3 models event evolution by aggregating temporally coherent clips, and finally, Module 4 generates a domain-adaptive summary s ^ \\hat{s} from the resulting event trajectories.",
