      "figure": "Figure 2",
      "caption": "Figure 2 : Overview of the HierAmp framework. Left: Scale-Restricted Class Token Attention Mask. The class token attends only to image tokens from the corresponding scale, with grey regions indicating blocked attention, producing a scale-specific semantic summary. Right: Multi-Scale Semantic Feature Amplification. The Amplify Algorithm selects the top attention positions from the class-token map at each scale and amplifies them via a positive logit bias, guiding the model to focus on semantically important features during decoding.",
