      "caption": "Figure 4. Overall pipeline of FAKER-Air. Our two-stage training framework begins with supervised fine-tuning (SFT) with rollout loss, followed by Group-Relative Policy Optimization (GRPO). During GRPO, multiple trajectory groups are evaluated using AQI-based rewards to guide policy updates, with the rollout horizon gradually increasing to enable long-term predictions.",
