      "figure": "Figure 3",
      "caption": "Figure 3. Illustration of the main framework. CME-MoE measures the distribution discrepancy of new incremental data and decides whether to reuse existing experts for stability or expand experts for plasticity, where expert expansion is initialized from a pre-trained meta- learned template via a meta-expansion mechanism to enable fast few-shot adaptation and reduce overﬁtting. SEPC monitors performance to detect under-represented distributions and expands the classiﬁer on demand to better capture multi-distribution decision boundaries.",
