      "figure": "Figure 2",
      "caption": "Figure 2 : Architecture illustration of the ProtoPFL with VPDR.\n① Private Prototype Calculation: each client runs VPP (Section 4.2 ) to privately partition embeddings, apply groupwise clipping, and add adaptive noise to prototypes;\n② Upload: clients send privatized prototypes;\n③ Global Prototype Generation: the server aggregates or trains global prototypes;\n④ Download: clients receive global prototypes;\n⑤ Local Fine-Tuning: each client fine-tunes locally with DCR (Section 4.3 ) for feature-norm stabilization alongside the task loss.",
