      "figure": "Figure 3",
      "caption": "Figure 3. Overview of GaussianFluent. Our model ﬁrst populates Gaussians in the internal volume and generates interior realistic texture with pretrained image generative models (Sec. 3.1). We then incorporate optimized CD-MPM simulation with mixed materials for Gaussian Splatting (Sec. 3.2) and introduce Blinn-Phong reﬂection in the rendering pipeline ( Supplementary Sec. C.1).",
