      "id": "cvpr26-33b0906d47a2",
      "figure": "Figure 2",
      "caption": "Figure 2. Framework overview of LLaMo. We utilize modality-specific Mixture-of-Transformer (MoT) to process text and motion tokens separately, while enabling cross-modal interactions through shared self-attention. To preserve the language performance of the base model, text-related modules are frozen. The [BOM] and [EOM] tokens denote the start and end of the motion sequence, respectively. An additional exit head allows the model to support flexible-length motion generation.",
