      "caption": "Figure 3. Overview of the Diffusion-based Reward Model (DRM). (Left) The training pipeline. During training, the DRM takes a pair of preferred and dispreferred images, both corrupted with noise at a speciﬁc timestep t, and predicts their respective reward scores. The model is then optimized via DR loss. (Right) The detailed architecture of our Reward Output Head.",
