      "id": "cvpr26-0e6c4ec28bcc",
      "figure": "Figure 3",
      "caption": "Figure 3. The pipeline of AeroGS. The pipeline begins with an Initialization stage (left), estimating poses and initializing octree anchors for the initial frames. It then enters an Incremental Frame Processing Loop (center), which jointly optimizes poses and the scene using our three core decoupling mechanisms: Ego-Motion & Object-Motion Decoupling (Sec. 3.2), Appearance-Deformation Decoupling (Sec. 3.3), and Scale-Complexity Decoupling (Sec. 3.4). After processing all frames, a Final Refinement stage (right) ensures global consistency. The sub-figures illustrate the details of each core decoupling component.",
