      "caption": "Figure 2 : Architecture Overview. Given an input point cloud, ArtLLM first predicts a tokenized articulation blueprint that specifies part layouts and kinematic structures . This blueprint then conditions a part-aware generative model to synthesize high-fidelity link geometries , followed by a physics-based joint-limit correction module refines the articulation, producing simulation-ready articulated assets.",
